Recursively defined list processing functions

Test LCOPY

Here is the original:
               ((O . R) (I . G) (I . N) (A . L))              

Here is the copy:
               ((O . R) (I . G) (I . N) (A . L))              

Are they EQU?
     No.

Are they EQUAL?
     Yes.


